    "starting_position": "Set up for Single-Leg Cable Pallof Press in proper position.",
    "setup_instructions": "Prepare body and equipment for Single-Leg Cable Pallof Press.",
    "steps": [
      "Step 1: Stand sideways to cable on one foot. Hold handle at chest.",
      "Step 2: Press handle directly out from chest with arms extending.",
      "Step 3: Hold pressed position for 2 seconds while balancing on one foot.",
      "Step 4: Return hands to chest with control."
    ],
    "breathing_instructions": "Breathe steadily; never hold breath during static holds.",
